ENGLISH SUMMARY (the Polish text above is the binding version)
Elektro Plan is free for personal, non-commercial use (your own home/apartment/garage, hobby, learning).
Not allowed without a separate written license: commercial use (paid design/installation work, business use,
client deliverables), selling/renting/sublicensing, hosting it as a service, redistributing it or modified
versions, removing notices, training commercial ML models on it. Your project files and exports belong to you.
Manufacturer names (SATEL, INTEGRA, VERSA, PERFECTA, ABAX) are trademarks of their owners; catalog values are
indicative. Results are advisory only and do not replace calculations, standards or a qualified electrician.
Bug reports and ideas are submitted by you, publicly, on GitHub (nothing is sent automatically; do not include personal data, addresses or access codes); you grant the authors a free, non-exclusive license to use their content to improve the software. Report security issues privately only.
Optional usage statistics (pseudonymous: counts, closed-list values and random IDs only; never names, addresses or project content) are sent to Umami only with your explicit opt-in and honor Do Not Track / Global Privacy Control.
Provided "as is" without warranty; liability is limited to the extent permitted by law.
